@startuml
title Environment Connection - set once
[*] --> UNCONFIGURED : new Application Environment
UNCONFIGURED --> CONFIGURED : SetConnection(READY scoped key, expectedVersion)\nCAS unset + version; persist derived profile/region/scope
CONFIGURED --> CONFIGURED : repeat/change/unset request rejected 409
note right of CONFIGURED
Immutable Connection/profile/region/scope.
AWS runtime PENDING -> READY separately.
Legacy binding migration enters CONFIGURED
with LEGACY_APPLICATION scope.
end note
note left of UNCONFIGURED
Draft/config edits are allowed.
Preview/Deploy rejected 422.
No default fallback.
end note
@enduml
